{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act51side_level_act51side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act51side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act51side_level_act51side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PA-4","storyName":"一墙之隔","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"听证会上，娜塔莉娅的“忏悔信”详述了她的见闻：她与巴普洛维奇协商后，见到了索尼娅并得知了封锁区里的情况。索尼娅希望娜塔莉娅她们能想办法切断暴徒们的武装供应。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act51side/level_act51side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act51side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["早露","沃伦佐娃夫人","急切的贵族","仲裁人","苦艾","巴普洛维奇","“十六勇士”打手","被雇佣的打手","凛冬"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_bg_72_g13_nobleroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"我必须重申一次，孩子。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"如果你只是来还书，仍不愿考虑我先前的建议，那么你可以把书放在那边的壁炉上，然后离开。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"难道只要我不同意您的办法，您就真的连一句旁的话也不愿和我说了吗？","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"放在其他时候，即使你因着年轻人可爱的轻率做出再多糊涂的选择，我都能继续同你促膝长谈，直到深夜。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"毕竟，我的确错过了许多。关于你，关于你父母，关于你们在切城的经历......","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"现在我同样能将这些都告诉您。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"可现在我却没有资格去听。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"面对关乎生死的问题，我无法说服你接受我的安排——离开圣骏堡避避风头，或者至少提交一份对自己有利无害的证词。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"我无法保护你，也就无颜面对你的父母，那我又有什么资格从你这里了解有关他们的任何事情？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#16$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"不是这样的，夫人——","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"这本书，你读了吗？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我读了，我全都读了，我已经明白您为什么要将它借给我。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"它的扉页上写着什么？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#2$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"“世上没有任何主义，值得人们用美好的生活去交换。”","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"是的，是的。雅科夫·彼得洛夫的《忏悔录》，在他死后由其家人整理出版，一本背叛者用死亡换来的经验之谈。所以，我真的不明白......","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"如果你知道已经有人为这经验付出过生命的代价，而自己还能有所选择，那又为何......一定要重蹈覆辙呢？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"难道一定要在你行将就木，甚至是像他一样在牢狱中咽下鲜血的时候，你才能意识到自己所坚信的只是注定被历史遗忘的瞬间？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"夫人，我......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"告诉我吧，孩子，告诉我为什么。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#9$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......说实在的，我也问过我自己。可如果......","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"请原谅我的厚颜无耻，我还想提一个要求。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"如果我能按照您的办法出具这份证词，保全自己，您能答应我，对自治团里的其他成员也一视同仁吗？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"当然！只要你能按那些人想要的，在证词里列出特定人员的名字——","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"好。那么，我会做的。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我会向听证会提交一份这样的证词......","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#3$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"一封“忏悔信”。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":60},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_bg_66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":62},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","duration":"0.5","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"伯爵夫人？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......啊，我在听。你想说什么？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"抱歉，我想提醒您，仲裁人刚才提到娜塔莉娅小姐了，一会儿需要您把她的证词递上去。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":73},{"type":"charslot","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"下一位证人，娜塔莉娅·罗斯托娃小姐。出于特殊原因，她本人今日不会出席。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"但是，她已提前申请，由现场某位人士代为诵读证词。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"仲裁人阁下——","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"charslot","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"娜塔莉娅小姐在昨日将信件交付于我，请仲裁委员会诸位大人过目，并允许我诵读。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":86},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"当书记官接过苦艾手中的信件时，窃窃私议的声音越来越大，沃伦佐娃夫人感到无数目光汇集于自身，她摇了摇头。","id":88},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"那么，请卓娅女士代为讲述娜塔莉娅小姐在此事中的见闻。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$2","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"“公正的仲裁委员会，以及受人敬仰的诸位大人，这是一封忏悔信......”","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"“出于我的悔意，与这封信所涉及的敏感之事，除了不得不谈论的巴普洛维奇外，我不会提及任何大人的具体姓名。”","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_177","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"急切的贵族","text":"（低声）夫人，这和我们说的——","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_177.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2173_1#1$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃伦佐娃夫人","text":"......先听她念完吧。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2173_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$2","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"“......我希望，这足以换取诸位的信任。”","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"charslot","id":104},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“在舞会事件发生后不久，出于对索尼娅安危的深切忧虑，我托一位有影响力的人士帮忙，成功联系到了当天大多数被捕学生的家长。”</i>","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":105},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“我得知，所有擅闯萨列夫格勒区的‘罪犯’，都将被统一关押在卡托加区，也就是现在人们口中的‘封锁区’。”</i>","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":106},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“令我意外的是，尽管家长中不乏地位显赫的贵族，他们也难以获得封锁区内的确切消息。”</i>","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":107},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“其中一部分人，是考虑到自身身份敏感，不便直接涉足封锁区。于是，他们委托我作为所有人的代表，前往探视被捕学生。”</i>","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":108},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“他们向我推荐了封锁区的管理者——枢密官巴普洛维奇。为拜访他，隔日我便登上了隔绝卡托加区与外界的城墙。”</i>","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"720","id":109},{"type":"subtitle","id":110},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":112},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_bg_bg_ltroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":114},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":115},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$sjoyasorrow_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_sjoyasorrow_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":116,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"......哈哈，我还见了一位您父亲的朋友，舒瓦洛夫男爵，当初他举债跑到切尔诺伯格搞投资，后来又一穷二白地回到圣骏堡。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_1","volume":"0.1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"但前天我们见面时，他被铐着双手，正由两位警官押着出城，要往东边送。我好奇问他，这是犯了多大的事儿，还要被流放？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"他神秘兮兮地凑到我耳边说，参加宴会的时候，他喊了一句“矿工万岁”。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"我惊讶地问他为什么，您猜他说什么？","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"抱歉，我猜不出来。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"他笑着回头，看向那两个押送他的警官，说：“被流放了，债主就找不到我了，哈哈哈哈。”","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"这真是，特别的见闻......如果我没有要事在身，或许听一天都不会疲惫。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"瞧我，一闲聊就停不下来，真是让您见笑了。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"来，亲爱的罗斯托娃小姐。我们先说正事。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"枢密官阁下，我是为——","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":139},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_2","volume":"0.6","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"尖厉的电钻声彻底搅扰了巴普洛维奇的兴致，他略带歉意地向早露挥手，起身走到门边。","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$1","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"怎么搞的？今天谁管事？给我出来！","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“十六勇士”打手","text":"对不起大人，昨晚带回来的人比较多......","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_2166_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#8$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"我管你有多少人？不知道我正在招待客人吗？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“十六勇士”打手","text":"我这就让他们停手。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_2166_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":155},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"不好意思，我们刚才说到哪儿了？","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......原谅我的好奇，枢密官阁下。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"圣骏堡各区的军警都有统一的装备，而刚刚与您交谈的那个人拿着武器，却身着便服。这里有什么特殊之处吗？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"特殊？哈哈，罗斯托娃小姐说笑了，除非您觉得垃圾场也很特殊。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"在圣骏堡工业转型升级后，老的工业区闲置久了，就有议员提出，可以把这些地方都改造一下，再利用起来。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"比如用来关些罪犯和一些不愿搬迁的穷人，在封锁区内就地搞生产，一举多得。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"本来运转得好好的，如果不是这几个月资源吃紧，这些工厂也不会全都停工。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"唉，乌萨斯从来不会在无用之处多费心思。正规的军警数量有限，给我的资金也只够雇这种白痴帮我管理。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"万幸的是，这些家伙至今为止还没有出过岔子。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"那刚才的钻头声，似乎也不是在装修——","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"啊，如果让您受惊的话，很抱歉。那是牙医在做手术，我也不愿他惊扰到我宝贵的客人。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"牙医？在这里？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"是的，他们要钻开虫蛀之处，把烂掉的东西挖出来，填上新的材料......无论是牙齿，还是思想。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"相信罗斯托娃小姐的好奇心已经得到满足了，我们该来谈正事了吧？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......实在抱歉。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"刚见面时，您看过我给的名单，我是受他们父母的委托而来，希望您能让我确认这些人的情况。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"尤其考虑到那名单之中不乏达官显贵的继承人，还请枢密官阁下通融。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"当然，当然。这次被捕的确实好像都是学生，可怜天下父母心，我当然知道那些大人物对自己的继承人有多么关切。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"这些孩子要是能够体谅半点他们父母的心思，又怎么会做出这种大逆不道、令父母伤心的事呢？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"可您也该体谅，我对于卡托加区的未来有多么关切。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"枢密官阁下，在与您进一步谈判前我得再次申明，委托我来的家长们希望能够确认孩子们的状态。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"当然，当然，一会儿有的是时间让您慢慢确认他们的安危。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"只是那份名单上有两个名字，我还想和罗斯托娃小姐讨论讨论。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"您请说。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"首先是瑙姆。据我所知，他已经在昨日被释放了，或许在您来的路上，他就已经到家了。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"感谢您的告知，我会尽快和他的家长确认。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"嗯，其次就是这位——索尼娅。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"短短几天她便在这里名声大噪，我也从手下那里了解到了不少有关她的事迹。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"索尼娅怎么了？","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":207},{"type":"text","text":"看着巴普洛维奇惯常挂在脸上的微笑，娜塔莉娅突然感觉到一丝异样。","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"别紧张，我只是好奇，她既非贵族，也不是富有人家的孩子，只是个普通学生，究竟为何能够出现在这份名单上呢？","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......我无意隐瞒。只因为索尼娅是我的朋友，并非什么真正穷凶极恶的暴徒，所以我才加上了她的名字，恳请您能让我确认她的情况。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"哦，天哪。罗斯托夫家的继承人向我求助，我怎么会拒绝呢？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"不过，您必须答应我两件事：其一，您告诉索尼娅，让她这几日安心留在封锁区里，我保证过几日就放她出去。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"其二，去依次告诉名单上学生们的家长，让他们向议会施压，撤回提案，保留封锁区，无论用什么手段。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"“保留”封锁区？您是指，卡托加区的区划很快就会被撤销？","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"哦，小姐，我们亲爱的沃伦佐娃夫人竟然没有告诉您吗？这里面对的可不是简单的撤销......而是赤裸裸的放弃。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"帝国资源枯竭已经不是什么秘密了。为了节流，帝国甚至已经窘迫到要放弃一块位于首都的工业地块。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"早在一周前，议会就有了放弃封锁区，将它抛在荒野上的提案。这提案得到了议长的许可，也就代表着陛下的默认。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"幸运的是，在一些支持我的旧贵族的力保下，这件事的推行得以拖延至今。但这不是长久之计。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"我注意到您的名单中有不少知名的产业贵族，倘若他们能鼓动各自亲友一同反对，想必陛下和议会也得重新考量。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"这关乎他们孩子的性命，他们绝不敢怠慢。一旦收到保留封锁区的敕令，我就放所有人离开。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......您认为我能做到？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"至少我对您抱有期待。凭您拿到了这份名单，毫无畏惧地来到这个人人避之不及的地方，还想救您的朋友。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"所以，包括索尼娅在内，所有人的性命都在您手上了，娜塔莉娅·罗斯托娃小姐。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我会转达的，但首先，我要见到索尼娅。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"当然。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"“小松针”，过来。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"charslot","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2158_1#1$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴普洛维奇","text":"带这位小姐去见索尼娅吧，记得要报上娜塔莉娅的名号。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_2158_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":245},{"type":"dialog","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"charslot","id":248},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":249},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_bg_72_g4_blockst.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","y":"-30","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormlp","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.8","id":252},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被雇佣的打手","text":"......这儿离那家伙——离索尼娅的驻地不远，你先等着，我去通报。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_2166_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"她在这里已经有驻地了？还需要“通报”？","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被雇佣的打手","text":"你是她的朋友，那肯定知道，她确实是个不好对付的家伙。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_2166_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":260},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":261},{"type":"text","text":"早露的嘴角不禁有了一丝笑意。阴冷的街道深处吹来一阵风，她扶住帽子，侧过头去。","id":262},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":263,"musicid":2},{"type":"text","text":"忽然，一道灰影从废墟里窜出。那是只瘦骨嶙峋的云兽，浑身癞斑，它停在路中间，警惕地看向早露，嘴里死死叼着一截东西。","id":264},{"type":"text","text":"早露的瞳孔骤然收缩——那是一根人的手指，苍白、僵硬，指甲缝里嵌着黑泥与血污，断口处像是被嚼碎的树枝。","id":265},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stickbeat","id":267},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被雇佣的打手","text":"*乌萨斯粗口*！该死的畜生！","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_2166_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":271},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smallanimal_scream","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被雇佣的打手","text":"娜塔莉娅小姐，你没事吧？","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_2166_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#9$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我......没事，它刚才......不，没什么。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#4$1","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"街道上实在有些冷，得麻烦您尽快请索尼娅出来了。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2166_1#1$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被雇佣的打手","text":"马上。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_2166_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":284},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.8","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"看着打手逐渐消失的背影，一阵寒颤从头打到脚，早露原本挺直的身躯猛地软了下来。","id":287},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"0.6","id":289},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"3","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":290},{"type":"backgroundtween","duration":"0.3","yTo":"20","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"她跌跌撞撞，最后倚在冰冷的砖墙上，捂住了嘴巴。将喉头的动静强行咽下之后，泪水却不受控制地涌出眼眶。","id":292},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"0","to":"0.61","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_bg_bg_school.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"一根指头，一个屈辱的灵魂的尖叫，一片关于切尔诺伯格的、浑噩的记忆，全都疯狂涌进少女的脑海。","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"这不是她第一次经历，她能够独自面对——","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"不，不能这样，娜塔莉娅。这是不体面的，是不被允许的，是能被克服的。","id":300},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":302},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_bg_72_g4_blockst.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"早露蹲在地上，大口地呼吸着金属味道的冷空气，试图先让手臂停止颤抖......","id":305},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rapidbreath_female","loop":"true","channel":"1","volume":"1","id":307},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":308},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"0.5","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rapidbreath_female","loop":"true","channel":"2","volume":"1","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.9","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.2","id":312},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"0.61","to":"1","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"0.8","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":315},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","loop":"true","channel":"zl","volume":"0","id":316},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"zl","fadetime":"1.5","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":318},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"zl","fadetime":"0.5","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"娜塔莉娅？","id":320},{"type":"dialog","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_heartbeat","volume":"0.7","channel":"HB","loop":"true","id":323},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"HB","fadetime":"1","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tinnitus_loop","loop":"true","channel":"em","volume":"0","id":325},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"em","fadetime":"1","id":326},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rapidbreath_female","loop":"true","channel":"3","volume":"0.7","delay":"0.2","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"3","fadetime":"0","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"（艰难地呼吸）","id":330},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":332},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1","id":333},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":334},{"type":"multiline","name":"凛冬","text":"你过呼吸了——","id":335},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":336},{"type":"multiline","name":"凛冬","text":"该死！娜塔莉娅，你能听到我说话吗？","id":337},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","id":339},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rapidbreath_female","loop":"true","channel":"4","volume":"0","id":340},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":341},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"0","channel":"4","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":343},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"4","fadetime":"0.5","id":344},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"em","fadetime":"1","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#16$1","duration":"1.5","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我、我——","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"告诉我，你现在在哪儿？","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#9$1","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我在......我在......封锁区......","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"对，你在封锁区——*乌萨斯粗口*你们一个两个的，到底进来做什么？找死吗？","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......该死，现在不该说这个。听我说，娜塔莉娅。我在你身边，你不是一个人。","id":356},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"娜塔莉娅！","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"false","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"索尼娅......？","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"对，是我。你还好吗？","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"索尼娅......不，我没事，很高兴看到你......","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"你也没事。","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#10$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"怎么还是语无伦次的。这是几？","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"text","text":"凛冬伸出三个手指，戳到早露面前。","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#1$1","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"三。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"哼，至少脑子没问题。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#1$1","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我没事，只是吹了风，咳嗽起来，心脏就有点难受。现在已经好很多了，谢谢你。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"行了，在我面前就别装了。是不是刚才来找我那家伙惹你了？","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"真的不是......唉，算了。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"听着，索尼娅，我能在这里停留的时间有限，必须尽快把目前的情况都告诉你。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"她四下打量，朝凛冬示意，希望她靠得更近些。","id":386},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","duration":"1","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......我知道了，你是从管事的人那过来的。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"先告诉你一声，烈夏目前也在这里，你还需要知道什么吗？","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"罗莎琳......她一直坚持要来找你，只在办事处留下封信就走了。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"不要责怪她，她也只是急着来帮我......我，我想问问大家都怎么样了？","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"古米还好吗？真理她有没有生我的气？还有卓娅和教官她们......","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"大家很好，但每个人都在担心你。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我过来也是想确认你的安全，以及这片封锁区......","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"我不知道你看到了什么，但这里发生的事，大概比你在这么短时间内看到的还要糟上不少。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"没有食物，没有燃料，甚至没有干净的饮用水。不同的人在拉帮结派，四处争斗，抢夺地盘和资源。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"每天都有人死。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"巴普洛维奇说他会放所有人离开，只是有些条件——","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"你不会真相信这种人说的话吧？","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我当然不......","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"我知道，你也没有别的办法，否则不会还要到处求人才能进来，还只能告诉我消息，看看我怎么样。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"怎么说呢，虽然刚才我说的好像很恐怖，仿佛明天大家就都玩完了，但这对我们来说并不陌生......","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"一片哪怕明天就爆炸也没人在意的封锁区域，一群为生存相互倾碾得几乎只剩下本能的学生......","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"这里的一切都有种熟悉的感觉，是不是？","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......告诉我，你现在需要什么？我还能离开这里，出去之后，我们这些在外面的人都会想办法——","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"我需要知道，这圈和堡垒一样的城墙上面有多少人？除了那些混混。","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"很少，巴普洛维奇请了几名保镖，加上穿旧款军队制服的那些也不超过十人。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......不错。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":430},{"type":"text","text":"凛冬往早露的方向靠得更近，迫切地压低了声音。","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"（小声）如果可能的话，尽量想办法切断他们的武装供应。","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"（小声）武装？可我看到他们的“安保人员”都不是专业的。","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"（小声）不，你不知道。","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"（小声）最近这里每天都有弹药补给和重型武器运进来，要是每个高地都有那样的大家伙守着，我们根本没有对抗的可能。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"你的意思是......","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"就是字面意思。","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_197_poca_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......我明白了，出去后我会和大家商量，一起想想办法。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"索尼娅，你和罗莎琳都要保重，一定要保护好自己。","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"别担心，我会出去的，会带着大家一起出去。","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"就像以前一样。","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":449},{"type":"dialog","id":450},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":451},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":452},{"type":"bgeffect","id":453},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":454},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":455},{"type":"image","id":456},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":457}],"characters":["早露","沃伦佐娃夫人","急切的贵族","仲裁人","苦艾","巴普洛维奇","“十六勇士”打手","被雇佣的打手","凛冬"]}